1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,540
W: Hi, my name is Sarah Ferguson, and I made a reservation for a non-smoking room with a view of the river for two nights.

2
00:00:08,165 --> 00:00:17,050
M: I'm terribly sorry, Ms. Ferguson, but our staff must have made a mistake , because according to the information in the computer, your room is facing the park, not the river.

3
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:18,260
W: That's terrible.

4
00:00:18,685 --> 00:00:21,820
I was hoping to have a nice view of the river from my room.

5
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,400
Oh well, I guess mistakes happen.

6
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,920
I'll just take the room facing the park then.

7
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:27,910
M: Thank you.

8
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:35,765
And to make up for our mistake, we would like to offer you a free dinner coupon for two at our hotel restaurant located on the basement floor.
